Dear Players, 
Thank you for your support and patience with "Miss Peacock"! 
This update focuses on game stability and experience optimization. 
Here are the details for Build v0.9.0:
 ▍Update Highlights
Full adaptation of CG images;
Fixed some instances of black screens when entering chapters;
Fixed the error of learning skills exceeding 100 points;
Fixed the status error of the auto-jump button;
Adjusted multiple plot points;
Optimized the collection system;
The game now starts in full screen by default;
Some other ancestral bugs have been fixed overnight.
 ▍Developer's Message 
This update marks a critical step towards the official 1.0 release of "Miss Peacock". 
Once again, we thank all players for your feedback and suggestions. 
Grateful to be on this journey with you!
 [Otter Club Games]
 [February 19, 2025]
